OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds line street for officer
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds have turned out for the
OL,7,Ffuneral of one of the police officers
OL,8,Fkilled in a wrong-way crash.
OL,10,FPC Matthew Blades, 37, and PC Tom
OL,11,FClough, 38, died when a Volkswagen
OL,12,FPassat collided with their marked armed
OL,13,Fresponse car on the A66 at South Bank,
OL,14,Fnear Middlesbrough, on 22 August. Five
OL,15,Fyoung men were also killed.
OL,17,FA full ceremonial police funeral took
OL,18,Fplace for PC Blades in Hartlepool
OL,19,Fearlier, with hundreds of officers from
OL,20,FCleveland and forces across the country
OL,21,Flining the street in a guard of honour.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
